# Safewright Cavalry: "This creature can't be blocked by more than one creature" (CR 509.1b). Bot1's Cavalry (4/4) attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's two Ornithopters
# may not both block it (the refusal) while one may; the Ornithopter that does dies (it deals no damage), and the Cavalry takes none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Safewright Cavalry
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
